<title>POLAND: Mostostal-K Q2 net rises to PLN 2 mln.</title>
<headline>Mostostal-K Q2 net rises to PLN 2 mln.</headline>
<dateline>WARSAW 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Mostostal Krakow preliminary results for the second quarter of the year ending June 30, 1997.</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of zlotys unless stated)</p>
<p>						Q2 1997	Q2 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 1.16 vs     0.45</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   2.86 vs     1.61</p>
<p>    net profit				 1.98 vs     1.04</p>
<p>NOTE - full company name is: Mostostal Krakow SA.</p>
<p>    net sales				 46.77 vs    38.22</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  43.83 vs    39.72</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.03 vs     0.05</p>
<p>    income tax				 0.85 vs     0.56</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.04 vs     0.01</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     4.11 vs     1.38</p>
<p>    financial costs			  2.44 vs     0.27</p>
<p>    investment				 0.46 vs     1.54</p>
<p>						H1 1997	H1 1996</p>
<p>    operating profit			 2.17 vs     1.41</p>
<p>    pre-tax profit			   5.34 vs     3.12</p>
<p>    net profit				 3.43 vs     1.76</p>
<p>    net sales				 78.64 vs    67.24</p>
<p>    costs of sales			  73.70 vs    61.01</p>
<p>    extraordinary profit		   0.09 vs     0.10</p>
<p>    income tax				 1.90 vs     1.34</p>
<p>    other taxes				0.00 vs     0.02</p>
<p>    financial revenues		     6.21 vs     2.02</p>
<p>    financial costs			  3.13 vs     0.41</p>
<p>    investment				 0.85 vs     1.76</p>
<p>-- Warsaw Newsroom +48 22 653 9700</p>
